AMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">2. 수업기간 : 2012. 6. 25(월) ~ 2012. 7. 22(일)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">【4주간(결？보강일 포함)】</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">3. 추천기한</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\"> : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">2012. 5. 10(목)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">까지&nbsp; </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">4. 신청학점</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\"> : 6학점 이내&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.2pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">5. 수강신청 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 신청기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">2012. 5. 21(월) 09:00 ~ 5. 24(목) 24:00【4일】 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 87.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -87.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 신청방법 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 29.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -29.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">충북대학교 홈페이지 접속(http://chungbuk.ac.kr) → Quick Menu 또는 재학생 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">→ 종합정보시스템 → 로그인(본교에서 부여한 학번, 주민번호뒷자리 입력) → 수업정보 → 수강신청 → </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">환불계좌번호 입력(본인계좌) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">→ 수강신청시작→ 교과목 코드번호입력</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 29.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -29.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 임시학번 부여 통보 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">2012. 5. 16(수) 예정</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 87.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -87.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 수강신청 제외과목 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">교직과목, 인턴십, 사회봉사 과목 수강신청 불가</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 87.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -87.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 87.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -87.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">6. 수강료</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\"> : 학점당 20,000원(실험？실습？실기 교과목은 시간당 2,000원 추가)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 87.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -87.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;ex) 3-2-2(학점-이론-실기)과목 1강좌 신청시 64,000원 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">7. 수강료 납부 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">가. 납부기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">2012. 5. 29(화) ~ 6. 01(금)【4일간】</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 납부장소 : 전국 농협중앙회</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 89.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -89.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 고지서 출력 방법 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 27.4pt; TEXT-INDENT: -27.4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;충북대학교 홈페이지</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">(</span><a href=\"http://chungbuk.ac.kr/\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\"><u><font color=\"#0000ff\">http://chungbuk.ac.kr</font></u></span></a><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">) → 재학생 → </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">종합정보시스템 → 로그인(ID:발급학번, PW:주민번호뒷자리) → 수업정보→ 계절학기납입금고지서출력 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">8. 수강취소 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;학생 본인이 취소기간 내에 수강신청 취소원을 작성하여 담당교수의 날인을 받은 후 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;본부(N10동) 학사과에 직접 제출</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"></p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"center\" width=\"176\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"29\"><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 10pt; TEXT-INDENT: -5pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">구분</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PAD